&#13;
&lt;b&gt;1. Extract Graphic Pack:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Extract the &lt;b&gt;BreathOfTheWild_!NoAO&lt;/b&gt; folder/file (provided by &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/1728449" target="_blank"&gt;inkursion&lt;/a&gt;) directly into your Cemu graphic packs folder:&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;code&gt;\graphicPacks\downloadedGraphicPacks&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;b&gt;2. Get RTGI Shader (Optional):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
• Buy the RTGI shader from &lt;a href="https://www.patreon.com/mcflypg" target="_blank"&gt;Pascal Gilcher's Patreon&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&#13;
• &lt;b&gt;Note:&lt;/b&gt; If you do not have access to RTGI, use the &lt;b&gt;No-RTGI version&lt;/b&gt; of this preset instead!&#13;
&#13;
&lt;hr&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;Shaders Used&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;CAS&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Clarity&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
