      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a7a6cb72d729.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a7a6cd20a847.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a7a6cdb8e50f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a7a6ce61c35b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a7a6df1736bd.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a7a6e075dfbe.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a7a6e164d40c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a7a6e23bd380.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a7a6e40c6031.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Mod:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;The &lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;Royal Guard's&lt;/span&gt; weapons are notorious for their awful durability, despite their high damage. This mod makes it possible to have the best of both worlds, without just upping the durability directly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Volcon&lt;/span&gt;, the Goron outside of the Goron City inn, will now upgrade your Royal Guard weapons into&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;Sturdy Royal Guard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; weapons using diamond and flint. A quest has been added for this, given Volcon, that will become available after beating Vah Rudania. Options are included to customize textures and durability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Options:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Textures:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Royal Guard - textures of sturdy weapons match royal guard weapons&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Royal - textures of sturdy weapons match royal weapons&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Custom - textures of sturdy weapons modified from royal weapons, purple swapped with red&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Durability:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Royal - durability matches royal equivalents&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1.5x Royal - durability matches 1.5x royal equivalents&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2x Royal - durability matches 2x royal equivalents&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Note:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The red exclamation point won't appear next to Volcon&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;</description>
