    <item>
      <title>Disable New Item Pickup Interruption</title>
      <author>Mstockwell</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/700072</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/700072#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">096802fedd2dc1a021482c64517f7158a56924dd</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 10:58:07 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a70735a5809a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a707416565d5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;&#13;
  Disable New Item Pickup Interruption is a quality-of-life mod for the Wii U&#13;
  version of &lt;em&gt;The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild&lt;/em&gt;.&#13;
&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;&#13;
  It replaces many of the game’s large first-time item cards and fanfare&#13;
  sequences with compact pickup notifications. This allows players to gather&#13;
  materials, collect enemy drops, search Guardian remains, and open chests with&#13;
  fewer interruptions.&#13;
&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Current Features&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;Compact pickup notifications are confirmed for:&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Ordinary loose ground pickups&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Dropped items&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Tested fruit and plant pickups&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Guardian treasure spots&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Successful chest rewards&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;First-time and previously obtained item types&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Full-Inventory Chest Handling&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;&#13;
  When a chest contains an item that cannot fit in the player’s inventory, the&#13;
  game now:&#13;
&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;ol&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Displays “Your pouch is full.”&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&#13;
    Shows the large item card identifying the exact reward still inside the&#13;
    chest.&#13;
  &lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Returns control without adding the item.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ol&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;&#13;
  The large card after the pouch-full warning is intentional. It identifies the&#13;
  blocked reward and does not mean the item was collected.&#13;
&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Public Beta&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;&#13;
  This is the first public beta of the expanded notification system.&#13;
&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;&#13;
  The confirmed routes have passed local testing, but&#13;
  &lt;em&gt;Breath of the Wild&lt;/em&gt; uses many specialized pickup and reward systems.&#13;
  Community testing is requested for:&#13;
&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Full weapon, bow, and shield chests&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Material stacks at 999&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Arrow bundles and other quantity rewards&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Korok seeds&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Ordinary non-Guardian treasure spots&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Wall-mounted collectibles&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Fish, insects, frogs, lizards, and fairies&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Grounded weapons, bows, shields, and arrows&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Amiibo rewards&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;NPC and quest rewards&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Multi-item rewards&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Cooking-result presentation&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&#13;
    Compatibility with other interface, inventory, chest, and EventFlow mods&#13;
  &lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Mod Manager&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;&#13;
  UKMM is the recommended mod manager for new installations.&#13;
&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;&#13;
  BCML is also supported, and this public-beta release has been directly tested&#13;
  and confirmed to install through BCML.&#13;
&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;&#13;
  Use only one mod manager for your active setup. Do not deploy separate UKMM&#13;
  and BCML merged outputs at the same time.&#13;
&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Installation&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;UKMM — Recommended&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;ol&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Download the release file from GameBanana.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Open UKMM.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Add or open the downloaded release file.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Enable the mod.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Apply the pending changes.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Deploy the merged setup if automatic deployment is not enabled.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Fully close and restart Cemu.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ol&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;BCML — Tested&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;ol&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Download the release file from GameBanana.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Open BCML.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Install the downloaded release file directly.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Re-merge, apply, or re-export the BCML setup.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Fully close and restart Cemu.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ol&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Compatibility&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Wii U version only&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Intended primarily for Cemu&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;UKMM is the recommended mod manager&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;BCML is supported and directly tested with this release&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&#13;
    Developed and tested with the US game at update version v208&#13;
  &lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Not compatible with the Nintendo Switch version&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&#13;
    Do not install alongside&#13;
    &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/353164"&gt;&#13;
      &lt;em&gt;Disable New Items Notifications&lt;/em&gt;&#13;
    &lt;/a&gt;&#13;
  &lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&#13;
    Mods that alter chest rewards, item-get presentation,&#13;
    &lt;code&gt;TitleBG.pack&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;GetDemo.bfevfl&lt;/code&gt;, or&#13;
    &lt;code&gt;Demo002_0.bfevfl&lt;/code&gt; may conflict&#13;
  &lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Reporting Beta Results&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;Please include:&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Exact item name&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Pickup or reward source&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Whether it was your first time obtaining the item&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Current inventory or stack state&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Expected behavior&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Actual behavior in exact order&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Reproduction steps&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Cemu version&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Game region and update version&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Mod manager used and its version&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Relevant active mods&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;&#13;
  Screenshots or a short video are especially helpful for incorrect&#13;
  notifications, missing messages, wrong item names, or message-order problems.&#13;
&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;&#13;
  For crashes or freezes, include the Cemu log from the affected session when&#13;
  available. Review the log before posting and remove personal file paths or&#13;
  other information you do not wish to share.&#13;
&lt;/p&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;p&gt;&#13;
  Do not upload memory dumps or other files that may contain sensitive system&#13;
  information.&#13;
&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/disable_new_item_pickup_interruption_v200_beta_1_7c5c5.zip" type="application/zip"/>
